data: {"id": "3e7bebc11e0c4eb3-thinking-parallel_evidence-1449", "run_id": "3e7bebc11e0c4eb3", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实\n\n1. **Pod 身份**：namespace=`aiops-case-09`，pod=`workload-5f4fb9ff45-7b77l`，UID=`13aa0496-5af5-4103-882f-2a096df0dc3f`，IP=`172.16.104.35`，运行在 node2 (10.2.0.50)。\n2. **生命周期**：phase=Running，无删除时间戳，owner=ReplicaSet/workload-5f4fb9ff45。\n3. **容器状态**：container `app` (image `xnet.registry.io:8443/observability/python:3-alpine`)，ready=False，但 restarts=0，exitCode=None。\n4. **条件**：Initialized=True，但 **Ready=False**，ContainersReady=False，原因=\"ContainersNotReady\"，message=\"containers with unready status: ", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 4, "ts_ms": 1788807445845, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

