- `fact-171ea59b73c7` 等 K8s 状态记录显示 `Ready` 条件为 `False`，`ContainersNotReady`；\n  - `fact-0bb73cc66881`、`fact-0df8dee1397b` K8s 事件记录探针失败及 503 状态码；\n  - `fact-6d5fd7218d3f` 等日志记录应用报出 `dependency unavailable` 错误；\n  - `fact-0d0416ee3286` Trace 追踪到 `/ready` 路由返回 `503`。\n\n- **缺失的决定性事实**：\n  - 日志中未体现具体是哪个依赖服务不可用（如 IP 或域名）；\n  - 缺乏 `INFO/DEBUG` 级别日志以进一步分析应用启动初期的连接建立过程或重试行为。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 2.0m\n├─ 问题定位: 32.7s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 76.1s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-09/workload-5f4fb9ff45-7b77l: 76.1s (Evidence 69.4s, RCA 6.5s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 13.5s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-09/workload-5f4fb9ff45-7b77l**: pod-notready-probe-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 122.268, "metrics": {"run_id": "3e7bebc11e0c4eb3", "mttr": {"value": "2.0m", "seconds": 122.27389740943909, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-notready-probe-failed", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-notready-probe-failed"}, {"name": "llm_self_